  "worked_solution": "| ${x}_{1}$ | **$1$** | **$2$** | **$3$** | **$4$** | **$5$** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${x}_{2}$ | **$8$** | **$15$** | **$29$** | **$22$** | **$41$** |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $-10$ | $-6$ | $5$ | $11$ |\n\nThe coefficients of the plane \n\n$$\ny={\\beta }_{0}+{\\beta }_{1}{x}_{1}+{\\beta }_{2}{x}_{2}\n$$\n\nthat best fits the data can be found as the least-squares solution $\\overset{^}{\\beta }$ to the system \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{X}{\\overset{\u23de}{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 15 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 29 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 22 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 41\\end{aligned}]}}\\overset{\\beta }{\\overset{\u23de}{[\\begin{aligned}{\\beta }_{0} \\\\ {\\beta }_{1} \\\\ {\\beta }_{2}\\end{aligned}]}} & =\\overset{y}{\\overset{\u23de}{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -10 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 11\\end{aligned}]}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $X$ is the design matrix, $\\beta $ is the parameter vector, and $y$ is the observation vector.",
